# exit: 1
# A SEARCH pattern is a pattern, not EasyCrypt input: a sentence-ending
# '.' inside it must not start a new command. The `split. admit' below
# is rejected outright -- the uuid must not move and COMMIT must stay
# empty. A qualified name (dots and all) is still a legal pattern.
LOAD "fixtures/simple.ec" 6
SEARCH (_ /\ _). split. admit
COMMIT
SEARCH (RField.ofint _)
